				<r3d:description language="eng">The Wind Data Hub (WDH), an AI‑ready data repository, provides secure access to curated observational and model datasets generated by projects supported by the Department of Energy’s Integrated Energy Systems Office (IESO). Its mission is to strengthen the security, reliability, and affordability of American energy by enabling research, fostering innovation, and advancing next‑generation energy solutions that support grid resilience, U.S. technological leadership, and reduced energy costs for consumers.</r3d:description>
